The lodge is listed among Polokwane''s graded accommodation options and takes bookings for travellers passing through or staying in the city for business or leisure. It suits guests who want a short-stay base with a recognised quality grading behind it rather than booking somewhere unrated, and its Hospital Park address keeps it within easy reach of the Polokwane CBD.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.safarinow.com/go/tirhanilodgepolokwane/', '$[#]', 'https://za.near-place.com/tirhani-lodge-57a-van-nispen-street-polokwane-ext-4-polokwane'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'tirhani-lodge-hospark' AND description = 'Tirhani Lodge is a 14-room guesthouse in Hospital Park offering double en-suite rooms with a private bath and shower, DStv, complimentary beverage-making facilities, an electronic safe and a telephone in every room, plus wheelchair-accessible parking.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
